{"unit_id": "tag:0CDQ:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）的 Galois 下降（descent）只是拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）的 fpqc 下降（descent）的特例。本节将说明如何把 Galois 下降（descent）转化为 fpqc 下降（descent），再应用前面的结果得出结论。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n设<MATH_0001>为域（field）扩张（extension）。则<MATH_0002>是 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）。设<MATH_0003>为<MATH_0004>上的概形（scheme）。对于<MATH_0005>代数（algebra）<MATH_0006>，令<MATH_0007>。由《拓扑（Topologies）》引理<REF_0001>，可知<MATH_0008>是 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）。注意<MATHSEG_0001>且<MATHSEG_0002>。因此，关于<MATH_0009>的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）的下降（descent）数据（datum），由拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）<MATH_0010>给出，它位于<MATH_0011>上，并带有同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0012>，此同构位于<MATH_0013>上，并在<MATH_0014>上满足一个显然的上循环条件（cocycle condition）。下面将具体说明 Galois 扩张（Galois extension）情形下这意味着什么。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n设<MATH_0015>为有限（finite）Galois 扩张（Galois extension），其 Galois 群（group）为<MATH_0016>。则有<MATH_0017>代数（algebra）的同构（isomorphisms）<MATH_0018>和<MATH_0019>。这里选择<MATH_0020>而非<MATH_0021>，是因为这样下面的公式会更简单，但这并非严格必要。给定<MATH_0022>，记<MATH_0023>。请记住，因为<MATH_0024>是反变函子（contravariant functor），有<MATH_0025>，而不是相反的次序。利用上述第一个同构（isomorphism），得到等同（identification）<MATH_0026>，使得<MATH_0027>对应于映射（map）<MATH_0028>，并使得<MATH_0029>对应于映射（map）<MATH_0030>。因此可知，下降（descent）数据（datum）<MATH_0031>，其对象为<MATH_0032>、底为<MATH_0033>，对应于同构（isomorphisms）族（family）<MATH_0034>。为了写出上循环条件（cocycle condition），使用等同（identification）<MATH_0035>，它来自上述代数（algebras）的同构（isomorphism）。通过此等同（identification），映射（map）<MATH_0036>对应于映射（map）<MATH_0037>，它将指标（index）为<MATH_0038>的分项（summand）映到（maps）指标（index）为<MATH_0039>的分项（summand），所用的是恒等态射（identity morphism）。映射（map）<MATH_0040>对应于映射（map）<MATH_0041>，它将指标（index）为<MATH_0042>的分项（summand）映到（maps）指标（index）为<MATH_0043>的分项（summand），所用的是态射（morphism）<MATH_0044>。最后，映射（map）<MATH_0045>对应于映射（map）<MATH_0046>，它将指标（index）为<MATH_0047>的分项（summand）映到（maps）指标（index）为<MATH_0048>的分项（summand），所用的是恒等态射（identity morphism）。因此，上循环条件（cocycle condition）<MATH_0049>转化为对每对<MATH_0050>的一个条件（condition），即<MATH_0051>，作为映射（maps）<MATH_0052>的等式。（一切都很吻合；例如，<MATH_0053>的目标（target）为<MATH_0054>，而<MATH_0055>的源（source）也为<MATH_0056>。）\n\n", "allowed_english": ["Galois", "fpqc"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "extension", "target_term": "扩张"}, {"source_term": "fpqc covering", "target_term": "fpqc 覆盖"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "fpqc covering", "target_term": "fpqc 覆盖"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "datum", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "cocycle condition", "target_term": "上循环条件"}, {"source_term": "Galois extension", "target_term": "Galois 扩张"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "Galois extension", "target_term": "Galois 扩张"}, {"source_term": "group", "target_term": "群"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "contravariant functor", "target_term": "反变函子"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "identification", "target_term": "等同"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "datum", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "family", "target_term": "族"}, {"source_term": "co